[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_RESISTANCE]
Friendship with Resistance

[en.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_RESISTANCE_desc]
Starlight Glimmer is close to the rich Eastern Equestria, while the Free Equestria is rampant over the ocean, carrying new goods that we, and even the whole world, have never seen. It must be a good choice to have friendly contact with them.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_RESISTANCE]
与抵抗军的友谊

[zh.FOCUS_C18_110_OPEN_TO_RESISTANCE_desc]
星光熠熠靠近富饶的东小马利亚，而自由小马利亚则横行于大洋之上，承载着我们、甚至整个世界未曾见过的新奇货物，与他们进行友好的接触，必然是一个不错的选择。

